flowchart TD
    SOURCE[TrialIQ checkout] --> IMPORT[1. Verify TrialIQ import source]
    IMPORT --> TARGETED[2. Targeted HITL/report/qualification contracts]
    TARGETED --> PYTEST[3. Full pytest regression]
    PYTEST --> BUILD[4. Frontend production build]
    BUILD --> API[5. Ensure live API]
    API --> PREFLIGHT[6. API + Neo4j + MCP + LLM preflight]
    PREFLIGHT --> QUALIFY[7. Qualify Basic / Intermediate / Advanced / HITL]
    QUALIFY --> HYGIENE[8. Repository hygiene inspection]
    HYGIENE --> AUTO[Automated stable-demo gate passed]
    AUTO --> MANUAL[Manual UI smoke\n4 qualified questions + PDF]
    MANUAL --> REPRO[Clean-clone dependency/install check]
    REPRO --> TAG[Stable demo release tag]
